  "notes": "12-step jade scale with a matching dark-mode scale. Steps 1-2: app and subtle backgrounds. 3-5: component backgrounds (normal, hover, pressed). 6-8: borders and focus rings. 9-10: solid backgrounds (e.g. buttons). 11-12: low and high contrast text.\n\nAlso available: jadeA (alpha) and P3 wide-gamut versions.\n\nUse: npm i @radix-ui/colors, then import \"@radix-ui/colors/jade.css\" and \"@radix-ui/colors/jade-dark.css\".\n\nOriginal file: https://github.com/radix-ui/colors/blob/main/src/light.ts",
  "code": "<style>\n:root {\n  --jade-1: #fbfefd;\n  --jade-2: #f4fbf7;\n  --jade-3: #e6f7ed;\n  --jade-4: #d6f1e3;\n  --jade-5: #c3e9d7;\n  --jade-6: #acdec8;\n  --jade-7: #8bceb6;\n  --jade-8: #56ba9f;\n  --jade-9: #29a383;\n  --jade-10: #26997b;\n  --jade-11: #208368;\n  --jade-12: #1d3b31;\n}\n.dark {\n  --jade-1: #0d1512;\n  --jade-2: #121c18;\n  --jade-3: #0f2e22;\n  --jade-4: #0b3b2c;\n  --jade-5: #114837;\n  --jade-6: #1b5745;\n  --jade-7: #246854;\n  --jade-8: #2a7e68;\n  --jade-9: #29a383;\n  --jade-10: #27b08b;\n  --jade-11: #1fd8a4;\n  --jade-12: #adf0d4;\n}\n.scale { font: 12px system-ui, sans-serif; width: min(720px, 100%); }\n.scale p { margin: 12px 0 4px; color: #555; }\n.scale .row { display: grid; grid-auto-flow: column; grid-auto-columns: 1fr; gap: 4px; }\n.scale .row div { height: 48px; border-radius: 6px; display: flex; align-items: end; padding: 4px; }\n.scale span { font-size: 10px; background: #fff9; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0 3px; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"scale\"><strong>Radix jade</strong>\n<p>light</p><div class=\"row\"><div style=\"background:#fbfefd\" title=\"--jade-1: #fbfefd\"><span>1</span></div><div style=\"background:#f4fbf7\" title=\"--jade-2: #f4fbf7\"><span>2</span></div><div style=\"background:#e6f7ed\" title=\"--jade-3: #e6f7ed\"><span>3</span></div><div style=\"background:#d6f1e3\" title=\"--jade-4: #d6f1e3\"><span>4</span></div><div style=\"background:#c3e9d7\" title=\"--jade-5: #c3e9d7\"><span>5</span></div><div style=\"background:#acdec8\" title=\"--jade-6: #acdec8\"><span>6</span></div><div style=\"background:#8bceb6\" title=\"--jade-7: #8bceb6\"><span>7</span></div><div style=\"background:#56ba9f\" title=\"--jade-8: #56ba9f\"><span>8</span></div><div style=\"background:#29a383\" title=\"--jade-9: #29a383\"><span>9</span></div><div style=\"background:#26997b\" title=\"--jade-10: #26997b\"><span>10</span></div><div style=\"background:#208368\" title=\"--jade-11: #208368\"><span>11</span></div><div style=\"background:#1d3b31\" title=\"--jade-12: #1d3b31\"><span>12</span></div></div>\n<p>dark</p><div class=\"row\"><div style=\"background:#0d1512\" title=\"--jade-1: #0d1512\"><span>1</span></div><div style=\"background:#121c18\" title=\"--jade-2: #121c18\"><span>2</span></div><div style=\"background:#0f2e22\" title=\"--jade-3: #0f2e22\"><span>3</span></div><div style=\"background:#0b3b2c\" title=\"--jade-4: #0b3b2c\"><span>4</span></div><div style=\"background:#114837\" title=\"--jade-5: #114837\"><span>5</span></div><div style=\"background:#1b5745\" title=\"--jade-6: #1b5745\"><span>6</span></div><div style=\"background:#246854\" title=\"--jade-7: #246854\"><span>7</span></div><div style=\"background:#2a7e68\" title=\"--jade-8: #2a7e68\"><span>8</span></div><div style=\"background:#29a383\" title=\"--jade-9: #29a383\"><span>9</span></div><div style=\"background:#27b08b\" title=\"--jade-10: #27b08b\"><span>10</span></div><div style=\"background:#1fd8a4\" title=\"--jade-11: #1fd8a4\"><span>11</span></div><div style=\"background:#adf0d4\" title=\"--jade-12: #adf0d4\"><span>12</span></div></div>\n</div>",
